#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:1
msgid "Agent Server Extensions"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:5
msgid ""
"Note that starting from `v0.221`.x, [the ACP Registry](https://"
"agentclientprotocol.com/registry) is the preferred way to install external "
"agents in Zed. You can learn more about it in [the release blog post]"
"(https://zed.dev/blog/acp-registry)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:8
msgid ""
"At some point in the near future, Agent Server extensions will be deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:12
msgid ""
"Agent Servers are programs that provide AI agent implementations through the "
"[Agent Client Protocol (ACP)](https://agentclientprotocol.com). Agent Server "
"Extensions let you package up an Agent Server so that users can install the "
"extension and have your agent easily available to use in Zed."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:15
msgid ""
"You can see the current Agent Server extensions either by opening the "
"Extensions tab in Zed (execute the `zed: extensions` command) and changing "
"the filter from `All` to `Agent Servers`, or by visiting [the Zed website]"
"(https://zed.dev/extensions?filter=agent-servers)."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:17
msgid "Defining Agent Server Extensions"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:19
msgid ""
"An extension can register one or more agent servers in the `extension.toml`:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:21
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[agent_servers.my-agent]\n"
"name = \"My Agent\"\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.my-agent.targets.darwin-aarch64]\n"
"archive = \"https://github.com/owner/repo/releases/download/v1.0.0/agent-"
"darwin-arm64.tar.gz\"\n"
"cmd = \"./agent\"\n"
"args = [\"--serve\"]\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.my-agent.targets.linux-x86_64]\n"
"archive = \"https://github.com/owner/repo/releases/download/v1.0.0/agent-"
"linux-x64.tar.gz\"\n"
"cmd = \"./agent\"\n"
"args = [\"--serve\"]\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.my-agent.targets.windows-x86_64]\n"
"archive = \"https://github.com/owner/repo/releases/download/v1.0.0/agent-"
"windows-x64.zip\"\n"
"cmd = \"./agent.exe\"\n"
"args = [\"--serve\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:41
msgid "Required Fields"
msgstr "必要欄位"

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:43
msgid ""
"`name`: A human-readable display name for the agent server (shown in menus)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:44
msgid ""
"`targets`: Platform-specific configurations for downloading and running the "
"agent"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:46
msgid "Target Configuration"
msgstr "目標組態"

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:48
msgid "Each target key uses the format `{os}-{arch}` where:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:50
msgid "**os**: `darwin` (macOS), `linux`, or `windows`"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:51
msgid "**arch**: `aarch64` (ARM64) or `x86_64`"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:53
msgid "Each target must specify:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:55
msgid ""
"`archive`: URL to download the archive from (supports `.tar.gz`, `.zip`, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:56
msgid ""
"`cmd`: Command to run the agent server (relative to the extracted archive)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:57
msgid "`args`: Command-line arguments to pass to the agent server (optional)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:58
msgid ""
"`sha256`: SHA-256 hash string of the archive's bytes (optional, but "
"recommended for security)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:59
msgid ""
"`env`: Environment variables specific to this target (optional, overrides "
"agent-level env vars with the same name)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:61
msgid "Optional Fields"
msgstr "必要欄位"

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:63
msgid "You can also optionally specify at the agent server level:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:65
msgid ""
"`env`: Environment variables to set in the agent's spawned process. These "
"apply to all targets by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:66
msgid ""
"`icon`: Path to an SVG icon (relative to extension root) for display in "
"menus."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:68
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "環境變數"

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:70
msgid "Environment variables can be configured at two levels:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:72
msgid ""
"**Agent-level** (`[agent_servers.my-agent.env]`): Variables that apply to "
"all platforms"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:73
msgid ""
"**Target-level** (`[agent_servers.my-agent.targets.{platform}.env]`): "
"Variables specific to a platform"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:75
msgid ""
"When both are specified, target-level environment variables override agent-"
"level variables with the same name. Variables defined only at the agent "
"level are inherited by all targets."
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:77
msgid "Complete Example"
msgstr "完整範例"

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:79
msgid "Here's a more complete example with all optional fields:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:81
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[agent_servers.example-agent]\n"
"name = \"Example Agent\"\n"
"icon = \"icon/agent.svg\"\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.example-agent.env]\n"
"AGENT_LOG_LEVEL = \"info\"\n"
"AGENT_MODE = \"production\"\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.example-agent.targets.darwin-aarch64]\n"
"archive = \"https://github.com/example/agent/releases/download/v2.0.0/agent-"
"darwin-arm64.tar.gz\"\n"
"cmd = \"./bin/agent\"\n"
"args = [\"serve\", \"--port\", \"8080\"]\n"
"sha256 = \"abc123def456...\"\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.example-agent.targets.linux-x86_64]\n"
"archive = \"https://github.com/example/agent/releases/download/v2.0.0/agent-"
"linux-x64.tar.gz\"\n"
"cmd = \"./bin/agent\"\n"
"args = [\"serve\", \"--port\", \"8080\"]\n"
"sha256 = \"def456abc123...\"\n"
"\n"
"[agent_servers.example-agent.targets.linux-x86_64.env]\n"
"AGENT_MEMORY_LIMIT = \"2GB\"  # Linux-specific override\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:106
msgid "Installation Process"
msgstr "安裝過程"

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:108
msgid "When a user installs your extension and selects the agent server:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:110
msgid "Zed downloads the appropriate archive for the user's platform"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:111
msgid "The archive is extracted to a cache directory"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:112
msgid "Zed launches the agent using the specified command and arguments"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:113
msgid "Environment variables are set as configured"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:114
msgid "The agent server runs in the background, ready to assist the user"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:116
msgid "Archives are cached locally, so subsequent launches are fast."
msgstr ""

