#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:129
msgid "SHA-256 Hashes"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:131
msgid ""
"It's good for security to include SHA-256 hashes of your archives in "
"`extension.toml`. Here's how to generate it:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:133
msgid "macOS and Linux"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:139
msgid "Windows"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:145
