msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:164
msgid "Icon Guideline"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:166
msgid ""
"In case your agent server has a logo, we highly recommend adding it as an "
"SVG icon. For optimal display, follow these guidelines:"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:169
msgid ""
"Make sure you resize your SVG to fit a 16x16 bounding box, with a padding of "
"around one or two pixels"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:170
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a clean SVG code by processing it through [SVGOMG](https://"
"jakearchibald.github.io/svgomg/)"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:171
msgid ""
"Avoid including icons with gradients as they will often make the SVG more "
"complicated and possibly not render perfectly"
msgstr ""

#: src/extensions/agent-servers.md:173
msgid ""
"Note that we'll automatically convert your icon to monochrome to preserve "
"Zed's design consistency. (You can still use opacity in different paths of "
"your SVG to add visual layering.)"
msgstr ""

